<script setup lang="ts">
import { computed, ref } from 'vue'
import { deliverySummary, PACKAGES } from '@/lib/delivery'
import { usePmisStore } from '@/stores/pmis'
import { PARTS } from '@/data/parts'
const pm=usePmisStore()
const emit=defineEmits<{openIssue:[id:string];openTask:[id:string];openDocument:[id:string];openAsset:[id:string];navigate:[tab:string]}>()
const packageId=ref('all'), asset=ref(''), kind=ref('全部'), query=ref('')
const summary=computed(()=>deliverySummary(pm.state,packageId.value,asset.value))
const findings=computed(()=>summary.value.findings.filter(f=>(kind.value==='全部'||f.kind===kind.value)&&`${f.id} ${f.title} ${f.owner}`.toLowerCase().includes(query.value.toLowerCase())))
function open(kind:string,id:string){if(kind==='工作')emit('openTask',id);else if(kind==='文件')emit('openDocument',id);else if(kind==='議題')emit('openIssue',id);else emit('navigate',kind==='查驗'?'inspections':kind==='會議'?'meetings':'issues')}
function exportSnapshot(){const content={project:pm.project,generatedAt:new Date().toISOString(),scope:'本機協作準備度快照；非正式驗收，不驗證文件內容或設備狀態',...summary.value};const url=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([JSON.stringify(content,null,2)],{type:'application/json'}));const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download=`delivery-${pm.project}-${packageId.value}-${summary.value.today}.json`;a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000)}
</script>
<template><section class="delivery"><header><div><h2>交付與驗收總覽</h2><p>整合本機工作、最新登錄文件、查驗、議題與會議紀錄。</p></div><button @click="exportSnapshot">匯出準備度快照</button></header><div class="filters"><label>成果包<select v-model="packageId"><option v-for="p in PACKAGES" :key="p.id" :value="p.id">{{p.name}}</option></select></label><label>模型群組<select v-model="asset"><option value="">全部模型／非模型工作</option><option v-for="p in PARTS" :key="p.id" :value="p.id">{{p.name}}</option></select></label><button v-if="asset" @click="emit('openAsset',asset)">定位篩選模型</button></div><p class="notice">此頁呈現資料登錄與協作狀態，不作正式驗收判定。DOC-17～20 選配不納基本統計；文件以「最新登錄版本」計算，並非經正式指定的有效施工版。P／WD 未設定 T0，不推算文件日曆逾期。成果包為追蹤分組；跨階段管理工作可重複列入，並非各階段正式接受條件。</p><div class="metrics"><article><b>{{summary.tasks.filter(t=>t.status==='已接受').length}} / {{summary.tasks.length}}</b><span>工作已接受</span></article><article><b>{{summary.documents.filter(d=>d.status==='已接受').length}} / {{summary.documents.length}}</b><span>最新文件版本已接受</span></article><article><b>{{summary.issues.filter(i=>i.status!=='已結案').length}}</b><span>未結議題</span></article><article><b>{{summary.inspections.filter(i=>i.status!=='已接受'||i.openDefects).length}}</b><span>查驗待處理／缺失未結</span></article></div><p v-if="!summary.tasks.length&&!summary.documents.length" class="notice">此範圍沒有對應工作或文件；不代表交付完成。請檢查模型關聯與成果包。</p><p v-if="!summary.inspections.length" class="notice">此範圍尚無查驗紀錄；不推定免驗或通過，必要查驗範圍仍待專案核定。</p><details v-if="summary.unclassified.length"><summary>未分類的全專案議題 {{summary.unclassified.length}} 筆（尚不能歸屬成果包或模型）</summary><button v-for="i in summary.unclassified" :key="i.id" @click="emit('openIssue',i.id)">{{i.id}} · {{i.title}}</button></details><h3>待處理事項 · {{summary.findings.length}} 筆</h3><div class="filters"><select v-model="kind" aria-label="待處理事項類型"><option v-for="k in ['全部','工作','文件','議題','查驗','會議']" :key="k">{{k}}</option></select><input v-model="query" aria-label="搜尋待處理事項" placeholder="搜尋編號、內容或責任窗口" /></div><p v-if="!findings.length">目前篩選沒有待處理紀錄；仍須確認資料完整性、查驗範圍與正式接受條件。</p><div v-else class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>類型／編號</th><th>內容與原因</th><th>責任窗口</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="f in findings" :key="`${f.kind}:${f.id}`"><td>{{f.kind}}<small>{{f.id}}</small></td><td><b>{{f.title}}</b><small>{{f.reason}}</small></td><td>{{f.owner||'未指派'}}</td><td><button @click="open(f.kind,f.id)">{{['工作','文件','議題'].includes(f.kind)?'開啟詳情':'前往管理'}}</button></td></tr></tbody></table></div><details><summary>文件版本核對（{{summary.documents.length}}）</summary><article v-for="d in summary.documents" :key="d.code"><button @click="emit('openDocument',d.code)">{{d.code}} · {{d.name}}</button><p>最新登錄：{{d.latest?.version||'尚無版本'}} · {{d.status}}</p><small>歷史已接受版本 {{d.acceptedVersions}} 份。新版本未接受時，不以舊版本抵銷。</small></article></details><details><summary>會議與行動追蹤（{{summary.meetings.length}}）</summary><article v-for="m in summary.meetings" :key="m.id"><b>{{m.title}}</b><p>{{m.status}} · {{m.openActions}} 項會議關聯議題未結</p><button @click="emit('navigate','meetings')">前往會議管理</button></article></details><footer>資料來源：目前瀏覽器保存的 PMIS 紀錄。篩選及匯出不修改任何工作或驗收狀態。工作、文件及查驗數量分開計算，不換算成工程完成百分比。</footer></section></template>
<style scoped>
.delivery{padding:18px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text);line-height:1.7}header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px}h2{font-size:20px;margin:0}h3{margin-top:22px}.filters{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:end;gap:10px;margin:12px 0}label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}button,input,select{font:inherit;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;background:var(--panel-solid);color:var(--text);padding:8px;max-width:100%}button{cursor:pointer}button:hover{background:#43c7ff14;border-color:#43c7ff}.metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:10px}.metrics b{display:block;font-size:25px;color:#7edaff}.metrics span{color:var(--muted)}article{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:12px;margin:10px 0}.notice{padding:10px;background:#ecb44312;color:#eac786;border-left:2px solid #d6a754}.table-scroll{overflow-x:auto}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;min-width:580px}td,th{text-align:left;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:10px 8px}small{display:block;color:var(--muted)}td:first-child{max-width:140px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}details{padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin:14px 0}summary{color:#7edaff;cursor:pointer}footer{color:var(--muted);margin:22px 0}p{overflow-wrap:anywhere}@media(max-width:800px){.metrics{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
</style>
